Modifications
-------------
- English translations and grammatical-function annotations added.
- Heisig (RTK) frame numbers and chapter assignments added
  (Heisig_numbers, Heisig_chapter columns).
- Kana-only words classified into 5 tiers (kana_tier column) and tagged with
  a kind classification (kind column: vocab | morpheme | loanword), per the
  RTK Companion kana tier system.
- Three rows added that were absent from the upstream corpus:
  あんな, それなら, ください.

